        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==aiohttp== is an asyncio HTTP server **and** client with WebSockets built in",
            "Server: `web.WebSocketResponse` upgrades a normal HTTP request",
            "Client: `session.ws_connect(url)` opens a WebSocket",
            "Each message is a `WSMessage` with `.type` and `.data`"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "☆ 2. Example: Server + Client"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async def handler(request):",
            "  ws = web.WebSocketResponse(",
            "      heartbeat=30)",
            "  await ws.prepare(request)",
            "  async for msg in ws: ...",
            "  return ws  # always!"
          ],
          "note": "handler must finally return ws"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "msg.type",
            "Do this"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "`WSMsgType.TEXT`",
              "`msg.data` is str"
            ],
            [
              "`WSMsgType.BINARY`",
              "`msg.data` is bytes"
            ],
            [
              "`WSMsgType.ERROR`",
              "log `ws.exception()`"
            ],
            [
              "CLOSE",
              "loop **stops** itself"
            ]
          ],
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "python",
          "lines": [
            "async with aiohttp.ClientSession(",
            ") as s:",
            "  async with s.ws_connect(",
            "      url, heartbeat=30) as ws:",
            "    await ws.send_json({\"op\": 1})",
            "    r = await ws.receive_json()"
          ],
          "note": "one session, many connections"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "☆ 3. Mechanism: Helpers + Options"
