            "Path, query params and `Depends()` work ==like HTTP routes==",
            "Browsers **can't** set headers on a WebSocket",
            "→ send the token in the ==query string== or the first message",
            "Reject: `close(code=status.WS_1008_POLICY_VIOLATION)` before `accept()`"
          ],
